 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. BETA1.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4).
 01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(6).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN.
     MOVE 1 TO WS-COUNT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL.
 LOOP.
     ADD WS-COUNT TO WS-TOTAL
     ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
     IF WS-COUNT < 11
         GO TO LOOP
     END-IF
     DISPLAY WS-TOTAL
     STOP RUN.
